# Property Research Agent — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env (already gitignored) and fill in real values.
# See PRD.md §7 "Config / Secrets Needed" and discussion.md for what each key is used for.

# --- Required ---

# OpenAI — used only for two things per the pruned architecture (discussion.md §1):
# parsing a free-text address out of the chat message, and answering follow-up questions
# from already-fetched data. Not used for the core data pipeline.
# Get a key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# RentCast — primary source for bed/bath, sqft, year built, owner name, mortgagee,
# HVAC type, and property tax amount (PRD §5). Free Developer tier: 50 requests/month.
# Get a key: https://www.rentcast.io/api
RENTCAST_API_KEY=

# Parallel.ai — fallback layer for any field RentCast returns null for, plus the
# recency-triggered bed/bath/sqft cross-check (PRD §5, discussion.md §2).
# Get a key: https://platform.parallel.ai
PARALLEL_API_KEY=

# --- No key needed (left here for visibility, not required in code) ---
# - US Census Geocoder — free public API, no auth
# - OpenStreetMap Overpass API — free public API, no auth; used for both fire station and
#   fire hydrant distance (fire station moved off HIFLD after DHS discontinued HIFLD Open
#   in Aug 2025 — see decisions.md, 2026-08-26)
